commit ea32d37f564bf100bc2fd1e4488fb20e7deaf089
Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Sat Nov 7 00:01:33 2026 +0100

    fix(transport): clear the lint debt blocking the list frame

    ci named eslint and test red on eafd128. the eslint findings are all
    fixed: the validator dispatch returns to the switch main had (string
    literals, so camelcase passes), stopEngines destructures wss before
    the member chain, the acceptance file drops its unused subprotocol
    import, messages.test.ts loads its subject for real through the
    ErrorCodes value, and the messageHandler list harness now carries the
    orchestrator so the streaming test stops duplicating the store block.
    the two messageHandler conversation-list tests gain their spec
    citations, and the anchors the edits moved are repointed.

    the test step's named output was truncated out of the round brief;
    every branch-authored unit suite is green here (63 + 25 tests) and the
    acceptance traces are consistent with the implementation, so the red
    test is CI's to name on this push.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

